  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b>The game has two game modes:</b>

    <i>-First one is player vs player
    (2 Player Mode):</i>

    --Right player is in red and is controlled with Up
    and Down arrow keys.

    --Left player is in blue and is controlled with W and
    S keys.

    --You can set a max score for the game you play with your friend
    with the MAX SCORE inputfield.

    --In two player mode we have 3 power-ups:
    First one is multiplier which count one goal for two. Second one is subtractor
    which subtract the opponent''s score by one. Third one is shield which create
    a shield on your score zone to protect it and won''t let your opponent to score.


    <i>-Second
    one is player vs ai (AI Mode):</i>

    --Right player is still controlled with
    the arrow keys but the left player now is an AI.

    --This game mode is with
    infinite score and you should set a record.

    --AI can score up to 3 goal
    and after that you lose. '
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 52e9b469254e42a4799d05143e98b0e9, type: 2}
